  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Afghan Citizens Resettlement Scheme Pathway 3 (ACRS P3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to providing a durable solution to beneficiaries of international protection by facilitating the resettlement of up to 1,500 beneficiaries to the United Kingdom between 1 July 2022 &#x2013; 31 March 2023. The pathway was designed to offer a route to resettlement for those who supported the UK effort.  For this project, IOM is facilitating video/telephone interviewing, provision of pre-migration health activities, and pre-embarkation checks to establish fitness to travel), three-day pre-departure cultural orientation sessions, facilitation of the visa/travel document processing and documentation support, and providing movement management and operational support to the final destination including operational and/or medical escorts if required and the delivery of information sessions to Local Authority, community sponsors, and other relevant resettlement stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
